import type { CatalogTechBase, ICatalogStanding } from "./data-interfaces";
// Conventional infantry weapons: statistics from the Conventional Infantry Weapons table (TechManual pp.349-352),
// Battle Values from the Conventional Infantry Weapons BV Table (TM p.319) and prices from the Conventional
// Infantry Weapons cost table (TM pp.298-301). One record per table row; a weapon with inferno ammunition has a
// second record, as the table gives it a second row. The Stetta auto-pistol's date row is misprinted without its
// Clan introduction column ("3010 (LC) - / NA NA / NA"); the record takes 3010 as its Inner Sphere introduction.
// The two-shot SRM launcher's inferno row prints its weight as "30.0 k"; the record reads it as 30 kg, as the
// row above it has. The Mandrake hold-out Gauss pistol and the hold-out needler pistol have a clip in the
// statistics table and the single-use footnote in the cost table; the records keep the clip and have no
// ammunition price.

